      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since all three initial status queries can independently invoke hostStatusCallback, startup can trigger up to three immediate createSensors rescans when host/chassis/POST are already true. Should we coalesce or debounce this to a single rescan to avoid redundant work?",
      "revId": "f987df5b4226b56fbae7ecbeb1140744b4d4a27f",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
